ReveAOSP | 0.01 Beta
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/ReveAOSP, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

# Initialize local repository
```
repo init -u https://github.com/reve-aosp/android.git -b calamity --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

# Build
- Set up the build environment
```bash
source build/envsetup.sh
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
breakfast codename
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m bacon
```

# Some flags may u need
---
- Animation fix for low-mid mtk devices
```
PERF_ANIM_OVERRIDE := true
```
- Use Kawase2 Blur Algorithm
```
TARGET_USES_KAWASE2_BLUR := true
```
